// "Exchange <left> and <right>", two numerical values [CR#701.12g]: each
// becomes equal to the other's previous value; a life total changes by
// gaining or losing life, and a power or toughness by a continuous effect
// that sets it. All or nothing, like every exchange [CR#701.12a].
(
    name: "exchangeValues",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"left": Amount, "right": Amount},
    body: Exchange(Values(Param(left), Param(right))),
)
